Package: com.xxzzddxzd.pnpm10
Name: pnpm 10 for DSH
Version: @PACKAGE_VERSION@
Architecture: iphoneos-arm64
Description: pnpm package manager running on the DSH iOS Node runtime
 Contains the upstream pnpm @PNPM_VERSION@ JavaScript distribution and wrappers
 that force pnpm and package lifecycle scripts to use the iPhoneOS Node 22
 runtime instead of the older system Node installation.
Maintainer: xxzzddxzd
Section: Development
Depends: com.xxzzddxzd.nodejs22 (>= @NODE_VERSION@)
Provides: pnpm
Tag: purpose::console, role::developer
Homepage: https://pnpm.io
Installed-Size: @INSTALLED_SIZE@
